<< /AP << /D 951 0 R /N 952 0 R >> /C [ 0.25 0.333328 1 ] /Contents (TRAIN WASHER\rColor light type signal is in service on North side of the track at the east end of the Train Washer. When this signal displays a green aspect movement may be made through the train washer. When red aspect is displayed, movement must not enter train washer. Speed through the train washer is not to exceed 3 MPH.\rUnless directed by a Mechanical Officer, cars or engines must not be put through the Train Washer when temperature bellow 32 degrees Fahrenheit. In case of doubt as to official temperature, Yardmaster on duty will dial 32 and temperature as given will govern.\r) /CreationDate (D:20080917163721-05'00') /F 156 /M (D:20080917163808-05'00') /NM (b28e44d4-b4da-4b4c-94e2-b2639a92f5a1) /Name /Comment /P 18 0 R /Popup 155 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt;font-weight:bold">TRAIN WASHER&#13;</span><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt">Color light type signal is in service on North side of the track at the east end of the Train Washer. When this signal displays a green aspect movement may be made through the train washer. When red aspect is displayed, movement must not enter train washer. Speed through the train washer is not to exceed 3 MPH.&#13;Unless directed by a Mechanical Officer, cars or engines must not be put through the Train Washer when temperature bellow 32 degrees Fahrenheit. In case of doubt as to official temperature, Yardmaster on duty will dial 32 and temperature as given will govern.&#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 147.848 93.3381 167.848 111.338 ] /Rotate 270 /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot >>
endobj
