578 0 obj
<< /AP << /D 951 0 R /N 952 0 R >> /C [ 0.25 0.333328 1 ] /CA 1.005 /Contents (City of Chicago  \rThe City of Chicago Office of Emergency Communications \(911\) Center has identified the following street crossings as being critical emergency routes: \r\rHarlem Avenue \rNarragansett Avenue \rOak Park Avenue \r\rWhen trains are stopped or anticipate to be obstructing any of these crossings for more than 10 minutes, a crew member must notify the train dispatcher immediately indicating amount of time the crossings may be blocked for. Crew must also notify the train dispatcher when the train is clear of the crossing.\r) /CreationDate (D:20080917172848-05'00') /F 28 /M (D:20080917173125-05'00') /NM (cb1f259d-76a4-4f48-820f-1140136f1994) /Name /Comment /P 38 0 R /Popup 579 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt;font-weight:bold">City of Chicago  &#13;</span><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt">The City of Chicago Office of Emergency Communications \(911\) Center has identified the following street crossings as being critical emergency routes: &#13;&#13;Harlem Avenue &#13;Narragansett Avenue &#13;Oak Park Avenue &#13;&#13;When trains are stopped or anticipate to be obstructing any of these crossings for more than 10 minutes, a crew member must notify the train dispatcher immediately indicating amount of time the crossings may be blocked for. Crew must also notify the train dispatcher when the train is clear of the crossing.&#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 286.528 569.518 306.528 587.518 ] /Rotate 270 /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot >>
endobj
