<< /AP << /D 951 0 R /N 952 0 R >> /C [ 0.25 0.333328 1 ] /Contents (Bensenville Yard to Schiller Park\rIf after pulling eastward through Tower B12 and movement will be delayed for westward movement into Bensenville Yard or Schiller Park, movement must pull further east and clear of Thatcher Avenue in order to reset automatic crossing warning devices. \r) /CreationDate (D:20080917173206-05'00') /F 156 /M (D:20080917173309-05'00') /NM (7fe289d3-1f12-4ad9-9c88-8b37c25fef48) /Name /Comment /P 39 0 R /Popup 611 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt;font-weight:bold">Bensenville Yard to Schiller Park&#13;</span><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt">If after pulling eastward through Tower B12 and movement will be delayed for westward movement into Bensenville Yard or Schiller Park, movement must pull further east and clear of Thatcher Avenue in order to reset automatic crossing warning devices. &#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 376.386 366.452 396.386 384.452 ] /Rotate 270 /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot >>
