<< /AP << /D 951 0 R /N 952 0 R >> /C [ 0.25 0.333328 1 ] /Contents (1. Approach Diverging aspect 9.1.7 \(Y-R-R\) indicates crossover movement at B12 through 40 MPH crxr's WEST of CN diamond. \r\r2. Approach Diverging aspect 9.1.7 \(R-Y-Y\) indicates crossover movement at B12 through 25 MPH crxr's EAST of CN diamond.\r) /CreationDate (D:20080917173451-05'00') /F 156 /M (D:20080917173525-05'00') /NM (b5f85f2d-b215-4413-bed1-e3b67c337f27) /Name /Comment /P 39 0 R /Popup 613 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt">1. Approach Diverging aspect 9.1.7 \(Y-R-R\) indicates crossover movement at B12 through 40 MPH crxr's WEST of CN diamond. &#13;&#13;2. Approach Diverging aspect 9.1.7 \(R-Y-Y\) indicates crossover movement at B12 through 25 MPH crxr's EAST of CN diamond.&#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 324.735 469.046 344.735 487.046 ] /Rotate 270 /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot >>
