endobj
842 0 obj
<< /AP << /D 951 0 R /N 952 0 R >> /C [ 0.25 0.333328 1 ] /Contents (The following conditions exist at the east end of the Elgin Coach Yard. \r\r1. Track #1 fouls the lead by approximately 110'.\r2. Track #2 just clears the lead-use extreme caution.\r3. Track #3 fouls track #4 by approximately 30'.\r4. Track #6 fouls the lead by approximately 115'.\r5. 2212's entire train sits on the lead east of the #1 switch.\r\rThis is for information only, use extreme care when spotting trains for standby power, and be advised that trains in these exact locations. \r) /CreationDate (D:20080917174355-05'00') /F 156 /M (D:20080917174427-05'00') /NM (13666bde-01c9-4fa9-96cc-6f3c91e07b42) /Name /Comment /P 51 0 R /Popup 843 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.0.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p><span style="text-decoration:;font-size:12.0pt">The following conditions exist at the east end of the Elgin Coach Yard. &#13;&#13;1. Track #1 fouls the lead by approximately 110'.&#13;2. Track #2 just clears the lead-use extreme caution.&#13;3. Track #3 fouls track #4 by approximately 30'.&#13;4. Track #6 fouls the lead by approximately 115'.&#13;5. 2212's entire train sits on the lead east of the #1 switch.&#13;&#13;This is for information only, use extreme care when spotting trains for standby power, and be advised that trains in these exact locations. &#13;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 338.886 536.264 358.886 554.264 ] /Rotate 270 /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot >>
endobj
